  "ui.agentMessages.dialog.validation_failure": "Y\xEAu c\u1EA7u thi\u1EBFt l\u1EADp n\xE0y kh\xF4ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ch\u1EA5p nh\u1EADn. H\xE3y c\u1EADp nh\u1EADt Local Operator r\u1ED3i th\u1EED l\u1EA1i."
