  "ui.common.updates.update_notification.the_server_needs_updating_by_hand": "C\u1EA7n c\u1EADp nh\u1EADt m\xE1y ch\u1EE7 th\u1EE7 c\xF4ng",
  "ui.common.updates.update_notification.the_server_serving_this_app_was_started_outside_local_operator_wh": "M\xE1y ch\u1EE7 ph\u1EE5c v\u1EE5 \u1EE9ng d\u1EE5ng n\xE0y \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c kh\u1EDFi ch\u1EA1y b\xEAn ngo\xE0i Local Operator; Local Operator kh\xF4ng kh\u1EDFi \u0111\u1ED9ng l\u1EA1i m\xE1y ch\u1EE7 m\xE0 n\xF3 kh\xF4ng kh\u1EDFi ch\u1EA1y: h\xE3y d\u1EEBng m\xE1y ch\u1EE7 \u0111\xF3 r\u1ED3i kh\u1EDFi \u0111\u1ED9ng l\u1EA1i Local Operator, ho\u1EB7c kh\u1EDFi \u0111\u1ED9ng l\u1EA1i c\xF4ng c\u1EE5 \u0111\xE3 kh\u1EDFi ch\u1EA1y n\xF3, \u0111\u1EC3 m\xE1y ch\u1EE7 ch\u1EA1y l\u1EA1i b\u1EB1ng b\u1EA3n d\u1EF1ng m\u1EDBi.",
